# Moderation

Hold keeps a record out of every public view until you decide, put back returns it, and remove keeps it out for good. Decisions are made with the form on the HTML page.

## Waiting for a decision

<%= if @quarantined == [], do: "_Nothing waiting._" %>
<%= for {kind, record} <- @quarantined do %>
- <%= subject_label(kind) %> `<%= record.id %>` · <%= stamp(record.inserted_at) %> · [view](<%= subject_path(kind, record) %>) — <%= line(subject_text(record)) %>
<% end %>

## Latest records

<%= if @latest == [], do: "_Nothing recorded yet._" %>
<%= for {kind, record} <- @latest do %>
- <%= subject_label(kind) %> `<%= record.id %>` · <%= stamp(record.inserted_at) %> · [view](<%= subject_path(kind, record) %>)
<% end %>

## Decisions

<%= if @decisions == [], do: "_No decisions yet._" %>
<%= for decision <- @decisions do %>
- <%= stamp(decision.inserted_at) %> · <%= decision.action %> <%= decision.subject_kind %> · <%= line(decision.reason) %>
<% end %>

<%= trailer() %>
